{#
  trust-pledge.njk — "How we operate" trust section for the homepage.
  Rendered after the reviews section (see templates/shop.njk).

  SellAuth Nunjucks constraint: static HTML only — no {% set %} arrays,
  no {% for %} over synthetic data.

  HOUSE RULE: every line in here is either a process commitment Zaza
  actually operates (delivery, downtime cover, dated status page,
  support channels) or a link the buyer can verify themselves. No
  invented numbers, no fake live counters, no fabricated activity.
  The middle card works BECAUSE the rest of the site never makes the
  claims it strikes out — keep it that way.
#}

<section class="ztp" aria-label="How we operate">
  <div class="ztp__head">
    {# Heading deliberately not "Don't trust us. Check us." any more. Four
       headings on this page in a row were built the same way — a short
       sentence, a full stop, then a second short sentence in a different
       colour ("The real menu. Live on a target.", "Same Server. Different
       Information.", "Two products. One workflow."). One of those is a
       nice piece of copy. Four in a row is a house style, and a house
       style that obvious reads as a template rather than as someone
       writing. This one and pair-block's were the two doing the least
       work, so they changed shape. #}
    <p class="ztp__eyebrow">// HOW WE OPERATE</p>
    <h2 class="ztp__title">Everything here is <span class="ztp__grad">checkable</span></h2>
    <p class="ztp__sub">Anyone can type "trusted" on a homepage. Below is what we put on the record instead, and where you can go to verify each line of it before spending a penny.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="ztp__grid">

    {# ---- Card 1: process commitments the store actually operates ---- #}
    <div class="ztp__card">
      <p class="ztp__card-tag">ON THE RECORD</p>
      <ul class="ztp__list">
        <li class="ztp__li">
          <span class="ztp__mark ztp__mark--ok" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span>Loader + key issued automatically the second payment clears &mdash; no human in the loop, nothing to "wait for".</span>
        </li>
        <li class="ztp__li">
          <span class="ztp__mark ztp__mark--ok" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span>Build down for 24 hours or more during your key? That time is added back or the key is replaced. Short update windows aren't compensated.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="ztp__li">
          <span class="ztp__mark ztp__mark--ok" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span>The status page is updated and dated with every release &mdash; so you see the state of the build before you buy, not after.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="ztp__li">
          <span class="ztp__mark ztp__mark--ok" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3.2L13 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span>Real people answer on Discord and email &mdash; pre-sale questions get the same energy as paying customers.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    {# ---- Card 2 (signature): the claims this store refuses to make ---- #}
    <div class="ztp__card ztp__card--refuse">
      <p class="ztp__card-tag ztp__card-tag--refuse">CLAIMS WE REFUSE TO MAKE</p>
      <ul class="ztp__list">
        <li class="ztp__li">
          <span class="ztp__mark ztp__mark--no" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M4 4l8 8M12 4l-8 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="ztp__struck">"100% undetected, forever"</span>
        </li>
        <li class="ztp__li">
          <span class="ztp__mark ztp__mark--no" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M4 4l8 8M12 4l-8 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="ztp__struck">"0% ban rate"</span>
        </li>
        <li class="ztp__li">
          <span class="ztp__mark ztp__mark--no" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M4 4l8 8M12 4l-8 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="ztp__struck">"Completely risk-free"</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="ztp__refuse-note">Nobody can honestly promise you these &mdash; and in this market, whoever does is lying to you. What we do instead: publish the real, dated state of every build so you decide with the same information we have.</p>
    </div>

    {# ---- Card 3: where to verify it all ---- #}
    <div class="ztp__card">
      <p class="ztp__card-tag">VERIFY EVERY WORD</p>
      <div class="ztp__verify">
        <a href="{{ '/status' | shopUrl }}" class="ztp__vlink">
          <span class="ztp__vlink-t">Live build status</span>
          <span class="ztp__vlink-d">Updated &amp; dated per release</span>
          <svg class="ztp__vlink-arrow" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M13 8l-4-4M13 8l-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="{{ '/feedback' | shopUrl }}" class="ztp__vlink">
          <span class="ztp__vlink-t"><span data-zz-rc>100</span> customer reviews</span>
          <span class="ztp__vlink-d">Word-for-word, stars and all</span>
          <svg class="ztp__vlink-arrow" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M13 8l-4-4M13 8l-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="https://discord.gg/zazacheats" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="ztp__vlink">
          <span class="ztp__vlink-t">Ask us anything first</span>
          <span class="ztp__vlink-d">Discord &mdash; costs you nothing</span>
          <svg class="ztp__vlink-arrow" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M13 8l-4-4M13 8l-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="{{ '/product/zaza-rust-private-cheat' | shopUrl }}" class="ztp__vlink">
          <span class="ztp__vlink-t">Still unsure? Test cheap</span>
          <span class="ztp__vlink-d">Shortest key = lowest-risk trial</span>
          <svg class="ztp__vlink-arrow" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M13 8l-4-4M13 8l-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <p class="ztp__foot">Pre-sale questions cost nothing: <a href="https://discord.gg/zazacheats" target="_blank" rel="noopener">discord.gg/zazacheats</a> <span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span> <a href="mailto:support@zazacheats.net">support@zazacheats.net</a></p>
</section>

<style>
.ztp{max-width:1080px;margin:72px auto 8px;padding:0 16px;
  font-family:var(--zz-sans)}

.ztp__head{text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 34px}
.ztp__eyebrow{font-family:var(--zz-alt);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:.68rem;
  letter-spacing:.16em;color:#BF40BF;margin:0 0 12px}
/* 700, not 900: this inherits Clash Display, which ships 200-700 on
   Fontshare, so 900 was drawn by the browser stretching the 700. */
.ztp__title{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3.6vw,2.4rem);font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#fff;line-height:1.12}
.ztp__grad{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#BF40BF,#c084fc);
  -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
.ztp__sub{margin:0;font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(200,215,240,.6)}

.ztp__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:stretch}
@media (max-width:940px){.ztp__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

.ztp__card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:22px 20px;border-radius:18px;
  border:1px solid rgba(191,64,191,.14);background:rgba(255,255,255,.015)}
.ztp__card--refuse{border-color:rgba(239,68,68,.22);
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(239,68,68,.05),rgba(255,255,255,.01))}

.ztp__card-tag{font-family:var(--zz-alt);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:.64rem;
  letter-spacing:.15em;color:rgba(200,215,240,.5);margin:0 0 16px}
.ztp__card-tag--refuse{color:rgba(252,165,165,.8)}

.ztp__list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:13px}
.ztp__li{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;
  font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.55;color:rgba(220,230,250,.82)}
.ztp__mark{flex-shrink:0;display:grid;place-items:center;width:20px;height:20px;
  border-radius:7px;margin-top:1px}
.ztp__mark--ok{color:#4ade80;border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,.3);background:rgba(34,197,94,.08)}
.ztp__mark--no{color:#f87171;border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,.3);background:rgba(239,68,68,.08)}

.ztp__struck{font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);
  text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-color:rgba(239,68,68,.75);
  text-decoration-thickness:2px}
.ztp__refuse-note{margin:16px 0 0;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px dashed rgba(239,68,68,.2);
  font-size:.76rem;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(220,230,250,.6)}

.ztp__verify{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.ztp__vlink{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px;
  padding:10px 34px 10px 12px;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none;
  border:1px solid rgba(191,64,191,.14);background:rgba(191,64,191,.04);
  transition:border-color .2s,background .2s,transform .2s}
.ztp__vlink:hover{border-color:rgba(191,64,191,.45);background:rgba(191,64,191,.09);
  transform:translateY(-1px)}
.ztp__vlink-t{font-size:.84rem;font-weight:700;color:#fff;line-height:1.3}
.ztp__vlink-d{font-size:.71rem;color:rgba(200,215,240,.5)}
.ztp__vlink-arrow{position:absolute;right:12px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);
  color:rgba(192,132,252,.7)}

.ztp__foot{margin:22px 0 0;text-align:center;font-size:.76rem;color:rgba(200,215,240,.68)}
.ztp__foot a{color:rgba(200,215,240,.75);text-decoration:none;
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(200,215,240,.25);transition:color .2s,border-color .2s}
.ztp__foot a:hover{color:#fff;border-color:rgba(191,64,191,.6)}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .ztp__vlink,.ztp__vlink:hover{transform:none;transition:none}
}
</style>
